  m_Name: MessageData 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  preview: Yo, need {item}. Don't wanna go out...
  introduction: Sup. Running low on supplies. Need {amount} of {item} delivered to
    my place. I've got {price} waiting for you. What's your ETA?
  acceptTask: Drop it somewhere near the corner store on 5th. Send pic when done.
  rejectTask: Eh, your loss. Too lazy to find someone else now. Great.
  bargainPositive: Eh, {price} works. Don't wanna argue. Just do it quick.
  bargainNegative: 'Nah, too much effort for that price. I''ll pass.

'
  dealOverPositive: Got it. Money's there. Whatever.
  dealOverNegative: Yo, it's been hours. I don't see shit. Had to go out myself now
    because of you. Thanks for nothing.
